{"game": "arma-3", "language": "english", "appid": 107410, "month": "2016-11", "window": 3, "start_date": 1479254400, "end_date": 1479859199, "month_true_total": 2776, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 11:06:06 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "26752681", "author": {"steamid": "76561197999059715", "personaname": "Pilgrimm", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/FormAndFunction/", "num_games_owned": 924, "num_reviews": 59, "playtime_forever": 201948, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 62516, "last_played": 1764499282, "avatar": "21228275b3080fbd08eb7de40fa8ef7ad3098425"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is the best Milsim I've ever played. And I can't stress enough how much of a milsim this is vs just being another shooter.  The learning curve is rather steep, but if you invest the time to learn, you will not be disappointed.\n\nMake sure you have a good CPU before you get too crazy with creating your own missions though.\n\n-----UPDATE-----\n\nI nominated this game for the ateam award Labor of Love because its been out for over 5 years, and the Devs are still making and updating DLC and content for this most excellent of games.", "timestamp_created": 1479847442, "timestamp_updated": 1543134904, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "26752028", "author": {"steamid": "76561198162276295", "personaname": "David VI Britannia", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198162276295/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 42, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 42, "last_played": 1431041530, "avatar": "2750ae74f24a081699d854b0d457f5b75928b2c8"}, "language": "english", "review": "Is an ok game to be perfectly honest with you :)", "timestamp_created": 1479844714, "timestamp_updated": 1479844714, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.49751242995262146", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "26751291", "author": {"steamid": "76561198134923668", "personaname": "Not ATF", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Uncoord/", "num_games_owned": 155, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 46855, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 19595, "last_played": 1563926222, "avatar": "85ee384bec86399cc79728cbde046516fa704b23"}, "language": "english", "review": "After 500+ hours, I think it's time to review this game. It is a multiplayer focused game and you benefit if you bring friends or join a Milsim unit. The mods add hours of fun into the game and arma 3 has modes for everyone. Overall this game is a must get, the downsides are it's not well optimized and is tough on mid tier PC's, but if you can look past that you will enjoy your time on the battlefield.", "timestamp_created": 1479841988, "timestamp_updated": 1480282990, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "26746889", "author": {"steamid": "76561198123707632", "personaname": "Jordan", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/jcinematics/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 38, "playtime_forever": 2805, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2458, "last_played": 1643296801, "avatar": "f77523a82d09d6a9a4d98e8d71d0a0d26159df06"}, "language": "english", "review": "After some time playing a few missions with friends it becomes boring but wait there are endless mods available to keep you entertained like this new mod ARMA 3: EDICT Mod which is like DayZ but more features and less bugs.\nOveral i'm playing arma 3 again just for ARMA 3: EDICT Mod.", "timestamp_created": 1479824488, "timestamp_updated": 1479824488, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "26746541", "author": {"steamid": "76561198167235913", "personaname": "BushWhookie13", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/reconsniper1983/", "num_games_owned": 91, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 170849, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 108919, "last_played": 1788200373, "avatar": "568b224de3353b115730c0c6a309369836d5f2ea"}, "language": "english", "review": "what needs to happen is fix the fps lag and stop the new stuff coming out. all money u spend on apex and stuff you could already fix the game... so in what way is it  better bringing new stuff out going to fix the game its not.. but buy the game its fun wish they had 2-4 player co op arma 3 campaine i know apex has it but like arma 3 is better", "timestamp_created": 1479822872, "timestamp_updated": 1479822872, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.477707028388977051", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}]}